{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-2","storyName":"排演一出悲剧","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"拍摄现场，谢莉陷入幻觉将自己置于险境，关键时刻被卢西恩所救。借由此次意外，卢西恩打探出了五年前的剧组事故——年轻女演员劳拉命殒片场。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["迈克尔","米兰妮","谢莉","？？？","卢西恩","莫伊拉","工作人员","格蕾塔","Miss.Christine","剧团成员A","剧团成员B","沉渊"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_62_g2_setting_rooftop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0.3","id":6},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":7},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","duration":"0","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-60","duration":"0","id":10},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","duration":"0","block":"false","id":11},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","block":"false","fadetime":"0","id":12},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","block":"true","fadetime":"0","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":15,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"忘记不幸遇害的兄长，跟我私奔吧，杜邦夫人！","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#5$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"清醒一点，第二个洛克菲勒！","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你也听到了那个信使说的，根本不存在什么“杜邦夫人”，什么高贵、优雅、知性......所有我身上你们所爱的东西都是无根的浮萍......","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我不配成为你们兄弟三人中任何一人的妻子。","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我爱你，就算你不姓杜邦我也依然爱你！","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"是你的兄长，那个死掉的家伙一直在利用你，你被蒙在鼓里，你也是受害者，你又何苦为此自责？","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"可是......","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"可是？","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"现在会客厅挤满了前来吊唁的宾客，虽然“杜邦”只是一个虚名，但于情于理我都不应该当着他们的面离开......","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我有方法能让我们现在就离开宅邸，从此再也不理睬家族纷争。","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这要如何做到？","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你忘记了？我是一名军人，亲爱的。","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你看！","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","focus":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这、这是......","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,-60","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.07","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我在这座宅邸的杂物间搜集了材料，制作了这副钢索......抓紧吊缆，我们就能从这个露台，直接飞跃花园，抵达屋后的森林。","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"跟我走吧，去一个不在乎财富和阶级的地方！","id":74},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":76},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":77},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"0,-300","power":"50","times":"1","duration":"1","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"jump","posto":"0,-300","power":"50","times":"1","duration":"1","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sldrsldng","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":82},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"啊，军人先生，你的方法还是太野蛮了！","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"万一滑轮卡住，我们会悬停在半空中好几个小时，直到有人发现我们......或者绳索断裂直接坠入森林......","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"相信我，装置非常安全。我不会让你受伤的，亲爱的。","id":87},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"真、真的吗，洛克菲勒？我、我觉得我要掉下去了——","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear","id":92},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":94},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":95,"musicid":1},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"啊——！","id":98},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"sticker","id":101,"text":"钢索、吊缆、悬挂、坠落。","x":"200","y":"300","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"sticker","id":103,"text":"坠落。","x":"307","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","duration":"8","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"sticker","id":105,"text":"坠落。","x":"307","y":"410","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","duration":"15","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear_break","id":107},{"type":"sticker","id":108},{"type":"sticker","id":109},{"type":"sticker","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$glass","delay":"0.5","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":112},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ambulancewhistle","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.5","id":113},{"type":"text","text":"“有人掉下来了！快，快叫救护车！满地都是血......谢莉！你还愣在这里干什么！”","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"脊背被寒意攫住，手指连动也不能动，神经也跟随绳索缓慢断裂的声音不断受到拉扯。","id":115},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"5","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"“到底是怎么回事......”","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"“所以，剧组的结论就是，她的死只是威亚自然老化造成的意外？就这样轻描淡写地解决了？这可是死了一个人！”","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"不像......对......两起事故一点都不像。道尔顿死于刀下，而五年前的演员死于坠亡。","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear","id":120},{"type":"text","text":"咯吱。咯吱。不祥的断裂声再次响起。在哪儿？究竟在哪儿？","id":121},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......谢莉，谢莉！","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"发什么愣啊，快离开那里，货箱要砸下来了！","id":125},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"curtain","id":127},{"type":"charslot","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":129},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":130},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_62_g3_filmset.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"砸......砸下来？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉僵在原地，呆板地抬头。","id":135},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","id":137},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenladder","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"她看着吊在空中的货箱离头顶越来越近，仿佛吊在空中的是自己，而她即将坠落。","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"在货箱占据谢莉视野的下一秒，影子出现在她的身旁，一双有力的手握住她的胳膊。","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉感到一阵天旋地转，回过神时她已离开了原来的位置，安稳落在拍摄现场的另一边。","id":148},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"卢西恩......谢、谢谢你。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"可以放手了。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"啊，对不起。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"不是说你。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"莫伊拉，你是叫这个名字吧......可以放手了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"好......好。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉这才看到，连接着货箱的绳索被小个子的道具师死死地拽在手上，她的手臂在颤抖，脸也憋得通红。","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"直到卢西恩重复了一遍，她才慢慢地松开手。","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":177},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":179},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_container_smash","volume":"0.7","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你的神经太紧绷了。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"这、这是我作为道具组长的职责。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"这到底是怎么回事......","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"怎么回事，我还想问你呢，怎么回事？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"这些货箱确实是有年头了，需要重新检查一遍以防绳索再次松脱，但你——","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"你真的是疯了，谢莉！","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"莫名其妙惊叫出声，打断了拍摄不说，连危险逼近了都不知道躲？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"你难道是第一次看剧组拍威亚戏吗，吓成这样？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"不......米兰妮和迈克尔的样子，让我想起了五年前那个坠落的——","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"谢莉，你先下去休息吧，别干扰剧组正常拍摄。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#2$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"（跳过道具箱）","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_MCcat_3","text":"","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"（贴近卢西恩）","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"没、没什么，这个神秘的黑家伙刚刚在那边乱窜，我被吓到了......","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"对不起，请继续拍摄吧。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#7$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"......","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_MCcat_4","text":"","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"（不满地甩动双尾）","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_62_g3_filmset.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"要是细看......谢莉长得也不差，就是总爱一惊一乍的，让人心里发毛。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"刚刚那场戏被打断真可惜，我的情绪正渐入佳境......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"“渐入佳境”？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"迈克尔，你要感谢那位统筹小姐。要不是她中断拍摄，下一秒我就要骂出口了。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"台词、身形、情感......一无是处，整整两个月的拍摄，到现在你的表现甚至没有那位只演了一场戏的新人亮眼。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我告诉过你，别把私生活的那一套带到拍摄里，现在看来，根本问题在于格蕾塔看走了眼。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"她根本不该找只靠一对红耳朵就接到戏的偶像派担任主演，还一人分饰三角。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"您说得对。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"哦，怎么蔫头蔫脑的？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"平时这个时候，你早就开始用油腔滑调的语气为自己辩解了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"这不是想起可怜的老道尔顿了吗......","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我没有您资深，进组经验也不够丰富。被谢莉刚刚的意外一搅和，现在又有些心神不宁。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"专业一点。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"意外、失败、负面评价......要是会被这些小事影响到表演的状态，根本没办法在蓝卡坞待下去。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"唉，我的承受能力还欠锻炼，得向您多多请教......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我听说玛丽安娜女士凭一部二十八天拍成的影片包揽蓝卡坞电影节各类奖项时，您就在她的身后？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"就算颗粒无收，被报纸和记者冷嘲热讽，您还是照常回到剧组完成了当天的拍摄。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"要是我必须跟这样璀璨夺目的演员竞争，可能早就不拍戏了......","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你什么意思？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我......哦！","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"不不不，您误会了，我只是想了解您面对道尔顿的意外能保持镇定的秘诀，绝对没有别的意思！","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"秘诀？没有什么秘诀，只是因为我并不熟悉道尔顿，也与那起事故毫无干系。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"反倒是你。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你为他心神不宁那么久，难道他的死与你有关？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_bg_62_g7_mobileplotstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":271,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"难道这一切真的只是巧合？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"难道只是我疑心太重？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"难道我真的该去看看心理医生？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"Miss.Christine不该成为你的借口。","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"谁！","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"谢莉小姐，Miss.Christine当时并没有出现在你所说的位置，更不会乱窜惊吓到你。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"卢西恩，代我向你的同伴说声抱歉吧。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我会的。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"所以，你恐惧的究竟是什么？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......你应该问五年前剧组发生意外后，还有什么不令我恐惧。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你的眼神写满了好奇。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我可以告诉你——其实本来也不是什么秘密，打听一下就能知道。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"那个发生意外的女孩，叫劳拉。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"她是一个初到蓝卡坞的新人演员，被格蕾塔女士招募进组，对自己的工作热情得过分，但完全不懂行业的规矩。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"道尔顿当时已经染上酒瘾，但风头仍盛。为了敲打一下不礼貌的后辈，他故意临时加戏，让小演员在威亚上吊了六七个小时。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"没想到装置老化，绳索松脱......那名演员坠落身亡。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"下一秒，血液从那名演员身下蔓延开，就像那天道尔顿的样子......","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩看向谢莉的手臂，潜意识的不安教唆她对自己的身体行凶，血痕遍布。","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉立即拉下挽在胳膊上的袖子，神色不安。","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我会解决自己的问题。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你低估了所谓的，“问题”。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"它会出现得越来越频繁，原本只是类似的声响才会引发幻觉，而现在哪怕只是拖动椅子，也会把你拉回那段过去。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"感谢你的关心，卢西恩“医生”。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我和我脑中邪恶的小声响已经相处了五年，我了解它们。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我只能跟它们赛跑，在恐惧和非理性彻底占据我的大脑之前，尽可能多做些什么。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"或许道尔顿的死真是一个意外，但我需要摒除所有风险和威胁，避免五年前的事再次上演。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"哪怕那些威胁来自于剧组的发起者......","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你还有别的顾虑。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"格蕾塔向我隐瞒了什么。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我们共用一个办公室，移动地块开出蓝卡坞主城区前，我在她桌上发现一份奇怪的文件，正想打开的时候被她拦下。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"谜题越来越多，而我跟那些相熟的成员分享着一段不堪的回忆，无法保持坦诚。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"现在还有恼人的声音和幻觉打断我的思绪......","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"疼痛是一种缓解方法。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你说......什么？","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我说，“疼痛”。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"它无法解决你的幻觉和癔症，但能为你提供喘息的机会，让你完成自己真正想做的事，解开未知的谜。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那些难以分辨真假的声音和影子会藏在细小的夹缝中，在你试图找回自我的时候阻止你，扰乱你......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"疼痛是用来对抗它们的方法，只不过指甲的硬度可能不够。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"笔尖、刀锋......只要用力得当，任何锐利的人造物品都能为你提供帮助。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"舌头、手背、腿根......这些部位对疼痛更加敏感。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你......真是个奇怪的人，但你似乎很了解幻觉。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你曾经用这种方法让自己镇静？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你到底是什么人？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"charslot","id":351},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_bg_24_RL_castlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$chenandwei_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14d0d0/m_avg_chenandwei_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":356,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"疼痛是一种缓解方式。","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"古怪的低语、可怕的景象......","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"只是和谢莉不同，他需要解决的问题，并非对这些事物的恐惧，而是，渴望。","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员A","text":"卢西恩还没把源石唱片机还回来？","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员B","text":"没呢。","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员B","text":"他估计也很着急吧，“白英花”不是说他最近焦虑得彻夜难眠吗？","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员B","text":"狂喜和狂悲都太表象了，他体会不到更复杂更极端的情感，自然也就没办法突破演技的瓶颈......","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员A","text":"但他还那么年轻，急什么？","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员B","text":"卢西恩已经加入剧团六七年了吧，最开始那么被看好，拥有最动人的歌声，接受剧团长的亲自教导......","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员B","text":"好不容易拥有了主演的机会，现在排练却遇到了瓶颈。","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团成员A","text":"可他把那几张唱片听再多遍，也解决不了问题啊！","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":373},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":374},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_recordplayer_smash","volume":"1","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#1$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"情感是演员的武器。那么第一步，你需要理解它们。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"老师说，狂喜和狂悲都只是表象，形似的模仿只会让你丧失对更复杂情感的感知。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#5$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"可是要怎么......","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"绝望，真正的绝望会让你失去最珍视之物，同时为你打开一扇新的门......","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#3$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你将聆听一切你不曾聆听之低语，你将目睹一切你不曾目睹之景象，你将感悟一切你不曾感悟之情感......","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你将成为，万物的明镜，戏剧本身。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#7$1","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"像这样——","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0.3","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","text":"","id":393},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","volume":"1","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","text":"","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#5$1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"咳，咳咳——","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":400},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩毁去了自己的歌喉。","id":401},{"type":"text","text":"源石结晶在一瞬间灌入伤口，疼痛与绝望将他淹没。","id":402},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"charslot","id":404},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":406},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":408},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"血......","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"痛......","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","id":416},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"卢西恩，别怕，我在这！","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"到底发生了什么？","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"（嘶哑的呜咽）","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"（变化的声线）原来......这就是......","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"卢西恩，是你自己把自己弄成了这样？","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"......","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"你还记得我之前的那次演出......或者说刺杀吗？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"我失败了。他们说，我是个可悲的懦夫。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"卢西恩，我已经不再是备受期待的艺术之子，我也不在乎那些孤立与嘲笑，因为我的心在那场演出后就已经不在剧团了......","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"可我还是留了下来......我们来自同个家乡，我们是......朋友。","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"你答应过我，不会像他们那样......","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"老师的话......是对的......","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"不......","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"我害怕......这座剧团，还有现在的你。","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"charslot","id":443},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":444},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":446},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_bg_62_g7_mobileplotstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"总之，它会比你想象中更有效。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"希望我永远用不上你教授我的“小技巧”。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":456},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":459},{"type":"image","id":460},{"type":"charslot","id":461}],"characters":["迈克尔","米兰妮","谢莉","？？？","卢西恩","莫伊拉","工作人员","格蕾塔","Miss.Christine","剧团成员A","剧团成员B","沉渊"]}